    "body": "The maintainer added in chat on 2026-11-22: the same goes for the option \"Pass starts at: Auto / Inside / Outside\". It must be expanded to all operations, as the start point and the exit point of #1448.\n\nThe scope of the parameter is therefore every operation whose passes or rings have an order: 2D Pocket, 2D Adaptive, 2D Offset, Face, Slot, Trochoidal slot, Circular, Bore, the 3D pocket and the 3D finishing passes where a ring order exists. It is not a patch for 2D Offset only.\n\nHow the work splits:\n- This issue (P2) fixes 2D Offset. It builds the parameter as a SHARED parameter: one type, one command (`EditOperationParams`), one MCP tool, one row on the Passes tab, one place in the project file. Auto keeps the current output of every kind.\n- The kinds other than 2D Offset get one sub-issue each (`Refs #3316` and `Refs #1448`, P4, enhancement). Where a kind has no pass order, its row says so by name.\n- The shared design is one decision file in `docs/decisions/`. The entry point of #1448 plugs into the same planner input later.\n- The worker of this issue adds no per-kind change beyond 2D Offset. It writes the sub-issue list.\n\nThe priority of the expansion is P4, because the maintainer asked for it in his own words. The fix of 2D Offset stays P2.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
